# Batch 01: exact symbolic / integer manipulation. Any cross-build diff is a UB signal.
simplify x + 0
simplify x * 1
simplify 2*x + 3*x
simplify (x + y)^2
expand (x+1)^3
expand (a+b+c)^4
expand (x-1)*(x+1)*(x^2+1)
factor x^2 + 2x + 1
factor x^4 - 1
factor x^3 + 3x^2 + 3x + 1
canonical x*y + y*x + 2*x*y
canonical (x+y)^2 - x^2 - 2xy - y^2
parse sin(x) + 2*cos(y)^3
parse a/(b+c) - sqrt(d*e)
parse (x + y) * (z - w) / (u + v)
show (x+1)^10
diff x^5 + 3x^2 - 7x + 2
diff sin(x)*exp(x)
diff log(x^2 + 1) x
diff x^2*y^3 x y
integrate x^3 + 2x from 0 to 1
integrate exp(-x^2) from 0 to inf
integrate 1/(1+x^2) from -inf to inf
sum(i, 1, 10, i^2)
prod(i, 1, 6, i)
closed sum(i, 1, n, i)
series exp(x) to 8
series 1/(1-x) to 10
